<title>DENMARK: A.P.Moeller buys Hyundai ships.</title>
<headline>A.P.Moeller buys Hyundai ships.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping and shipbuilding firm A.P.Moeller said on Monday it had ordered three container ships from South Korea's Hyundai Heavy Industries.</p>
</text>
